check 1
# Act 1 hireling death and resurrect (q-chk-hirelings, REC-1516): hire as hire-kashya.check, then
# the hireling's life (stat 6) is poked to 0 at frame 40 (death: world/hirelings.md §8; S->C 0x9B with the
# resurrect cost, §13), the player goes back to the seller (poke goto) and resurrects it with C->S 0x62
# (npc.md §7.4; cost min((L*L/2)*15, 50000), hirelings.md §9: life full, state cleanup, stats resent,
# pet follow to the player).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name hire-resurrect-kashya
save ScnHr1 --class bar --expansion --level 30 --gold 100000
seed 1234
ticks 130
seconds 500
channels state packets
at 4 poke goto unit 1:150
at 8 send InteractWithEntity type=1 id=@1:150
at 10 send InitEntityChat id=@1:150
at 14 send HireMerc npc=@1:150 merc=3411
at 40 poke stat @1:271 6 0 0
at 70 poke goto unit 1:150
at 80 send InteractWithEntity type=1 id=@1:150
at 82 send InitEntityChat id=@1:150
at 86 send ResurrectMerc npc=@1:150
